/// Frontier Brain/late-challenge full mask `7`), indexed by
/// `FactoryAiPolicyBranchId`'s declared order: 0 tent, 1 frontierBrain,
/// 2 challengeBelow2, 3 challengeBelow4, 4 challengeAtLeast4
